---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="ArkheionX Changelog" description="Public source-state changelog for ArkheionX.">
  <header class="page-intro page-shell">
    <p class="page-kicker">Source history</p>
    <h1>Changelog.</h1>
    <p>This page describes the current public-safe source state. It does not imply that a matching binary artifact or GitHub Release exists.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="page-shell">
    <section class="prose-section">
      <p class="eyebrow green">Current source state</p>
      <h2>v3.9.0</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Added the deterministic local/static fixture benchmark harness.</li>
        <li>Added source fingerprints for registered fixture inputs.</li>
        <li>Added snapshot drift checks and public safety consistency tests.</li>
        <li>Preserved local-first review maps, evidence links, review packages, and validation artifacts.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Source installation is available from <code>main</code>. Binary releases are planned but not published.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="prose-section">
      <h2>Detailed repository history</h2>
      <p>The source repository contains the complete historical changelog and milestone notes retained in the public-safe branch.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Yudis-bit/DeFi-Exploit-PoCs/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">Read CHANGELOG.md</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
